# Allowed publisher identity for /rby1/cmd/joint and /rby1/cmd/pose.
# rby1_core compares this against the incoming header.frame_id:
#   frame_id == source -> command is used; otherwise it is dropped (throttled WARN).
# A single value is shared by both topics (joint and pose are never used together).
# Empty string rejects ALL command publishers.
string source
---
bool success
string message
